Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.49,0:00:06.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然這次又要逃走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:07.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:11.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會饒恕你 居然背叛吉魯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:14.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 雷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:15.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:32.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 讓Destiny和Legend做出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:35.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:38.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被逃犯搶了MS 外出追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:44.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但接下來怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:46.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,找ArchAngel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:49.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那艘船…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:50.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有沉沒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.31,0:00:52.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉肯定也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:53.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:55.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.13,0:00:57.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 雷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:00:58.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:00.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:02.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 但為什麼又會有間諜什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:04.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別大意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.99,0:01:06.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,追的是阿斯蘭 薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:12.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:16.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會 為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:18.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發佈A55警報
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:20.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,42 666 準備
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:36.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:50.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼啊 雷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.89,0:01:53.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原因不明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.63,0:01:55.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但他被保安部追捕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:58.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反將其擊倒後逃走是事實
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:03.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 不然真的會被他逃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE-37  雷鳴之闇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:50.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 警報?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:51.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:03:58.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有間諜?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:03:59.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是Logos嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:01.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,混在匯集來的軍隊中嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.49,0:04:04.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回船上去會不會比較好?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:06.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:09.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,搶走了GOUF?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.09,0:04:10.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,追擊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 艾爾加隊正趕過去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,追擊已經命令真和雷去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:21.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在更重要的是別讓騷亂擴大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:26.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若出現奇怪的謠言 也會影響投靠來的各國軍隊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:29.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是目前絕對不希望出現的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.33,0:04:30.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:32.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:35.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,侵入主機的終端機確定了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:39.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:43.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是Minerva乘員梅琳 霍克的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:47.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva的? 那她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.85,0:04:49.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.27,0:04:58.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:04:59.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:04.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在追擊阿斯蘭時 有看到梅琳 霍克嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:07.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳 霍克和阿斯蘭在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:08.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.65,0:05:12.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和阿斯蘭? 這麼說是人質嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:16.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我認為不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:19.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他掩護梅琳 打掉我的槍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:23.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,企圖進入GOUF駕駛艙時 向她伸出了手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她毫無抗拒地接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:29.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該有攝影記錄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:30.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:35.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼她並不是作為人質被帶走的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:37.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 不是人質
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:42.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭…那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:45.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她是情報專家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:47.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖不清楚內情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但若就此讓他們逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知會洩漏多少機密
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:55.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳也…為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:58.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為必須阻止其逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:00.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請批准擊墜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:01.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:04.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:08.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你的判斷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:10.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,批准擊墜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:11.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:13.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:15.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:16.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到了吧 真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:19.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:21.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 這…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:26.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從右側追擊 迂迴至前方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:29.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:30.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果因為這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:34.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,辜負議長及其跟隨者們的期望該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:40.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在絕不容許這種背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:42.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做好覺悟吧 真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:44.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要制止他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:53.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 雷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:11.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:14.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:20.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你…！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:29.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:31.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是被人操縱的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種技倆是沒用的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:36.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太丟人了 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:37.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:48.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別逃了 投降吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別背叛 回基地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:56.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:07.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 我沒打算就這樣被殺掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:09.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽著 真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:15.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長和雷所說的聽起來或許是名正言順
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:25.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但他們的那些話 最終會抹殺世界上的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:31.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我對那些…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.96,0:08:33.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 別聽他的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:45.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭已經有點不正常了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:48.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:51.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別被他迷惑 真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 無論如何都要打的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.66,0:08:55.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,至少讓梅琳下去 她是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:09:00.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她已經和你同罪 是不該存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:04.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:07.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他是敵人 他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:11.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,背叛議長 背叛我們
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.02,0:09:15.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,踐踏我們的信任 這能夠饒恕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:21.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也說過的吧 這樣的話能和任何敵人戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:22.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:32.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽完議長的話後 我很感動
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:37.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長明知很困難卻毫不退縮 不言放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.81,0:09:42.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 我也能和任何敵人戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:47.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這場戰爭結束後我就想創造出這樣的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:52.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都能幸福生活的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:55.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就再也不會有戰爭了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:10:00.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以為了那一天 希望你們現在好好努力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:02.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:08.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要做這種事… 你們又想打仗嗎!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.09,0:10:15.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我是瑪尤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:17.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 瑪尤現在…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:18.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:21.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因此 告訴那些欲加以阻撓的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:23.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界真正的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:27.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是你不好 是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:30.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為你背叛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:34.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:10:59.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:04.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕不會再…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:07.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.93,0:11:35.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:38.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹得好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:41.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的任務完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,任…務
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:48.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯…蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:51.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:55.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們把背叛的他們…敵人解決了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:11:59.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做了該做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:33.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,報告
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:36.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,GOUF已擊落
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:38.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Legend返航
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.56,0:12:42.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.52,0:12:50.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,庫萊巴 將事情經過簡單地整理出一件文件
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:53.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合方面已經開始問東問西了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:54.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.05,0:12:58.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為當前狀況和現場調查需要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:03.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要求他們不要進入現場海域
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:04.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:07.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,另外梅琳 霍克有個姐姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:09.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請她過來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:13.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,必須把情況告知她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:16.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也有些事要問她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.21,0:13:19.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能麻煩你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:20.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:24.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們必須搜查他們在Minerva上的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.31,0:13:26.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,庫拉提斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:28.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 請便
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:32.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但在此之前希望和您談談
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:35.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用這樣看著我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:37.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也正打算這樣做 塔利雅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:42.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我也有些問題得問你才行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:46.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭是我主張其歸隊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:47.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並任命為FAITH的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:50.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事情竟然演變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也大受打擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.39,0:13:57.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給你添麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:02.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:08.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,稍後一定會安排時間 請稍安勿躁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.14,0:14:21.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.91,0:14:23.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.43,0:14:30.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳…梅琳她為什麼要…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:34.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不可能 她不會做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:35.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:39.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這些 肯定是哪裡搞錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:42.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會有這麼荒謬的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:50.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:51.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:54.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:56.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然拜託你們那麼重大的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:58.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.63,0:15:02.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但幹得很好 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:04.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擊落它的是真
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:11.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊…的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:20.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 阿斯蘭和梅琳為什麼會牽扯上那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:25.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛艙還未發現所以不得而知
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:29.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們Ragnarok的資料有被入侵過的跡象
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:31.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Ragnarok?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:34.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Heaven's Base攻擊作戰的代號名稱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.63,0:15:37.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是有點小題大作的名稱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:42.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但其中還包括了Destiny和Legend的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:46.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想入侵雖然不是件容易的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:50.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果是精通情報處理的人員 或許…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:51.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:57.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他還打算帶走拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:03.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但被拉克絲拒絕 我們也因此得知此事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.37,0:16:08.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底為什麼 想去哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:14.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然攻擊ArchAngel和Freedom的命令似乎讓他很生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.77,0:16:15.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:19.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為失去後盾 開始焦急了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.46,0:16:20.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:23.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那更該知道他想去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:27.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要Ragnarok情報的地方只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:29.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Logos?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.95,0:16:35.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開戰時他表示無論如何都想阻止這種事態發生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.65,0:16:37.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為如此我才信任他並讓他歸隊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:43.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那為什麼對攻擊Logos阻止戰爭產生反感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:44.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:46.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我理解您的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:49.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但事態如此 再煩惱也沒有意義
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:52.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有我們在 議長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:53.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.06,0:16:58.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都支持在困難情況下選擇這條極端道路的議長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.59,0:17:00.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們等候下一個命令
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.41,0:17:09.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:13.27,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(630,636)}{\fad(500,0)}ZAFT軍事站
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:14.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海茲隊按預定工作時間
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:18.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各相關人員立刻開始準備
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:23.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空降登陸A班15點開始進行作戰解說 各隊長…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:32.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:34.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Legend
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.61,0:17:38.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次由真和雷駕駛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.36,0:17:40.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳被他…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:43.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 別提這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:44.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對別再提…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:54.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:18:00.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦內情況如何 司令部發表的報告大家都看了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:04.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 大家都很受打擊 有所動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.43,0:18:06.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.58,0:18:08.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:10.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 能再麻煩你一件事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:13.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣無法坐上艦長席
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.51,0:18:15.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:17.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:18.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:46.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:23.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,法納斯和先頭部隊出航
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:26.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,4號碼頭維扎里卡 9號碼頭伊拉士瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.09,0:19:28.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,10分鐘後預定出航
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:31.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第15機動艦隊C航線完成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.08,0:19:33.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.85,0:19:35.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:42.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非做不可 我們正是為此策劃至今
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:46.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿基馬隊全體出擊 西里奧隊準備出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:51.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,路線清理完畢 旗艦BB01允許出港
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:55.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,旗艦BB01 Minerva發來通知
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:57.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全軍跟隨我艦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.71,0:20:01.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首先發出警告
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.77,0:20:09.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要求交出基地內以Logos為名的 羅德 吉普利爾氏等人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:10.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.41,0:20:17.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以談談 那應該沒有壞處才對
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:40.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入間隔311 牽引隊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:43.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放射線管理隊到A維修場待命
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.14,0:20:49.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 立刻開始修理和補給工作 趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:53.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,直布羅陀開始向Heaven's Base發出警告
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.47,0:20:57.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們ZAFT與地球聯合軍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:21:00.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對Heaven's Base做出以下要求
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:03.75,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(636,632)}{\fad(500,0)}地球聯合軍 最高司令部 Heaven's Base
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:06.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第一 要求立即交出先前公佈的Logos成員
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.21,0:21:10.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第二 全軍解除武裝 放棄基地設施
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:12.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:14.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉艦長 我想和拉克絲談談
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:16.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能取得聯繫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.95,0:21:19.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不快點不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然可能就來不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:24.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.95,0:21:26.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Heaven's Base陷落的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:28.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個恐怕就是奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.71,0:21:34.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到那時誰都無法阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:49.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要消除戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:51.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真正地…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:25.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自己親眼所見
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.15,0:23:27.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自己親耳所聞
