Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.53,0:23:41.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人們透過戰火看見的世界是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.04,0:23:45.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士 GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:47.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新的旗幟
